Z||000000||AusFiero||08-11-2001||07:11 AM||||    Well I got a friend to take a picture of my car today. Stripped for Stage 2 kit that is well underway now. I have a workshop now so I couldnt get any pictures of the kit till I get my USB ports fixed during the week. Then I will post lots as the first scoops will be getting shipped by Friday next week. I decided to damn the expense and time and am getting really stuck into it to try finish all the kit within 1 month. Yes I am up to it if I work short hours.<BR>   Anyway, back to my poor baby, doesnt it look sad like that  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif"> . Will look great soon again though (c: . By the way I fixed my cut in half doorskin, it is the other side. I just put it back on and filled the gap with a flexible epoxy resin. Thank god for side mouldings though, it looks a mess without it. I will also have a lot of standard panels for sale soon too and tail lights, I wont need them anymore.<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/stripped001.jpg">  <P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.jadeweb.com.au/fiero/ausfiero1.gif"> <BR><A HREF="http://www.jadeweb.com.au/fiero" TARGET=_blank>My Fiero</A> | <A HREF="http://www.auto-alley.com" TARGET=_blank>Fiero Accessories</A>||202.139.20.3||reg||9
